{"id": null, "n": "0196001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0196001", "type": "orig", "text": "本文譯自Mahajjhatakamqlq（大本生蔓）第四十九章，見 M. Hahn 編輯的 Der Grosse lengendenkranz:Mahajjhatakamqlq, 1985年由 Otto Harrassonwirz 出版社在 Weisbaden 出版，原文為梵文。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0196002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0196002", "type": "orig", "text": "見M. Hahn, Der Grosse lengendenkranz: Mahajjhatakamqlq, Weisbaden: Otto Harrassowitz, 1985。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0196003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0196003", "type": "orig", "text": "M. Hahn, Mahajjhatakamqlq, 第4頁和第6頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0196004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0196004", "type": "orig", "text": "M. Hahn, Mahajjhatakamqlq, 第6頁和第10頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197001", "type": "orig", "text": "約西元3～4世紀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197001", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0197001", "type": "mod", "text": "約西元3【藏外】，～4世紀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197002", "type": "orig", "text": "約西元4～5世紀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0197002", "type": "mod", "text": "約西元4【藏外】，～5世紀。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197003", "type": "orig", "text": "M. Hahn, Mahajjhatakamqlq, 第6頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197004", "type": "orig", "text": "M. Hahn, Mahajjhatakamqlq, 第8頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197005", "type": "orig", "text": "見 Schlingloff, Studies in the Ajanta paintings, Ajanta publications, 1988。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0197006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0197006", "type": "orig", "text": "這部分大約有600頌左右。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0198001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0198001", "type": "orig", "text": "在漢文三藏中沒有一部獨立的關於寶髻的著作，但是他的名字不斷以「寶髻」二字出現，亦即梵文所用的「Mazicfa」和「Ratzacfa」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0198002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0198002", "type": "orig", "text": "Brajendra Nath De 在一百年前首先將寶髻王的故事翻譯成英文，詳見「The Story of King Manicuda」, Journal and Text of the Buddhist Text Society of India, 1893, 第三期，卷一，第27～39頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0198003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0198003", "type": "orig", "text": "參見他的文章 Mazicfqvadqnam as related in the fourth chapter of the Svaya/bhpurqza, 刊於 Jounral of Royal Asiatic Society, 1894年第26號，第297～319頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0198004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0198004", "type": "orig", "text": "最新的關於佛教文學中施捨生命（Dehadqna）的主題可參見 Reiko Ohnuma 1997年在密西根大學提交的博士論文, Dehadqna:The「gift of the boody」in Indian Buddhist Narrative Literature。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199001", "type": "orig", "text": "Ratna Handurukende 所著 Mazicfqvadqna Being a translation and Edition and Lokananda a Transliteration and Synopsis, London: Luzac & Co., 1967; 同一作者的 Mazicfqvadqna, Sacred Books of the Buddhists, Vol.24, London: Luzac & Co ., 1967。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199002", "type": "orig", "text": "Stockholm: Almqvist and Wiksell, 1963。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199003", "type": "orig", "text": "M. Hahn 將其譯成英文，題為：Joy for the World. A Buddhist Play by Candragomin, California: Dharma Publishing, 1987。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0199004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0199004", "type": "orig", "text": "P. L. Vaidya, Buddhist Sanskrit Texts, Vol.22, Chapter 3, Bihar: Mithila Institute, 1959。這篇本緣故事於1990年由 Bonnie Rothernberg 譯為英文，作為其博士論文的一部分，題為：K2emendra's Bodhisattvqvadqnakalpalata A Text Critical Edition and Translation of Chapters 1-5, University of Wisconcin。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200001", "type": "orig", "text": "參見 Skandapurqza 第67章，Gurumandal 系列第20，Calcutta: Manasukharai, 1959-60。見 P. L. Vaidya (ed.) Buddhist Sanskrit Texts, No.21, Bihar: Mithila Institute, 1959；《大正大藏經》，T155, T186 , T187。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200002", "type": "orig", "text": "見 P. L. Vaidya (ed.) Buddhist Sanskrit Texts, No.21, Bihar: Mithila Institute, 1959；《大正大藏經》，T155, T186 , T187。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0200003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0200003", "type": "orig", "text": "見 F.Edgerton, (ed. And trans.) Vikrama's Adventures, Harvard Oriental Series, Vol.26、Harvard University Press, 1926。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0202001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0202001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「dharma」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0212001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0212001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「bodhisa/vara」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0215001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0215001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「1ubha」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0216001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0216001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「Mazicfa」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0216002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0216002", "type": "orig", "text": "這裏原文是「Ratzacfa」,與「Mazicda」同義。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0217001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0217001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「atidana」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0220001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0220001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「dharma」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0220002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0220002", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「1udha」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0220003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0220003", "type": "orig", "text": "「賢山」原文為「Bhadragiri」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「atidqna」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223002", "type": "orig", "text": "根據印度神話，巴厘是一個半人半仙的人物，盧舍那的兒子，掌管著世界。大神毗濕奴變成一個小矮人，向巴厘挑戰，巴厘答應給毗濕奴他三步能跨過的土地。毗濕奴變成的小矮人三步跨越了整個宇宙，成了世界之王。最早記載這則神話的是梨俱吠陀，1、54。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0223003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0223003", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「atidqna」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0234001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0234001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「Padmqvat」，意思是「有許多蓮花的」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0238001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0238001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「1uddha」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0238002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0238002", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「vi1uddha」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0239001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0239001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「pari1uddha」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0239002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0239002", "type": "orig", "text": "四梵行即：maitri（慈）,karuza（悲）,mudita（喜）和upeksa（施）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0239003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0239003", "type": "orig", "text": "「rsya」，譯為「嫉妒」，根據上下文我猜想它或許應該為「rya」，「修行者」，或指修行時身體的四種姿勢，即行走，站立，坐和躺臥。見 F.Edgerton, Buddhist Hybrid Sanskrit Dictionary, 第116頁。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0256001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0256001", "type": "orig", "text": "這裏梵文本原文是「tadadrstva」,意即「看見了……」；然而根據上下文，用「adrstva」（沒有看到……）似更合理。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0260001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0260001", "type": "orig", "text": "文中為「bhiksur」,僧侶。從上下文看，巴伐菩提可能暗指的是小乘僧侶。在大乘佛教信徒眼中，小乘遠非十全十美。在這裏，文中很清楚是在對比林居的僧人與那些以施捨為功德的修菩薩行的佛教徒。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0262001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0262001", "type": "orig", "text": "文中似有誤，按上下文推断，原文似應為「nqnumodita」（不被說服），而不應該是「anumodita」（高興、愉快）。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0265001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0265001", "type": "orig", "text": "「實行善行」原文為「Bodhicaryqvrata」,即「修菩提行」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0272001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0272001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「Bodhicaryqvrata」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0280001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文中有一詞「ativqhya」意義不清，上下文也不清楚。可能在這句之前原文詩句有闕失。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0280002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0280002", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「atidqna」,極度的，大量的施捨。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0284001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0284001", "type": "orig", "text": "指難敵王。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0319001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0319001", "type": "orig", "text": "在前面的故事中提到有五個婆羅門，而不是四個。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0320001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0320001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「Pqramitq」。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0320002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0320002", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「Trividha」,意指身，口，意三方面。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0330001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0330001", "type": "orig", "text": "原文為「Pqramitq」。"}
